		<item>
		<title>Baby Moose Wandered Up To Alaska Airlines Check-In Entrance — As One Man Shooes It Away</title>
		<link>https://viewfromthewing.com/baby-moose-wandered-up-to-alaska-airlines-check-in-entrance-as-one-man-shooes-it-away/</link>
					<comments>https://viewfromthewing.com/baby-moose-wandered-up-to-alaska-airlines-check-in-entrance-as-one-man-shooes-it-away/#comments</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Gary Leff]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 13:04:20 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Airports]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[anchorage]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://viewfromthewing.com/?p=259265</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[A baby moose trotted past passengers unloading their bags curbside at Anchorage airport, then stopped near the Alaska Airlines check-in doors. A man simply walked toward it, waved an arm, shooed it away getting it to turn around.]]></description>
		
					<wfw:commentRss>https://viewfromthewing.com/baby-moose-wandered-up-to-alaska-airlines-check-in-entrance-as-one-man-shooes-it-away/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
