		<item>
		<title>$12,000 Buffalo–New York Fares Making Headlines—I’m Finding Nonstops For $337 Roundtrip</title>
		<link>https://viewfromthewing.com/12000-buffalo-new-york-fares-making-headlines-im-finding-nonstops-for-337-roundtrip/</link>
					<comments>https://viewfromthewing.com/12000-buffalo-new-york-fares-making-headlines-im-finding-nonstops-for-337-roundtrip/#comments</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Gary Leff]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 22:04:55 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Airlines]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://viewfromthewing.com/?p=259222</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[A $12,203 airfare between Buffalo and New York about 300 miles each way - is going viral as evidence of how expensive it's gotten to fly home for the holidays. The TikTok video that started it off though shows a roundtrip price (not one-way) and connecting both directions in Florida (not non-stop). ]]></description>
		
					<wfw:commentRss>https://viewfromthewing.com/12000-buffalo-new-york-fares-making-headlines-im-finding-nonstops-for-337-roundtrip/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
